; ==========================================
; First Steps in Hebrew / עברית (he)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

sim kufsa 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
hosef kufsa 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
haser kufsa 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
hare kufsa         ; Show the final candy count!
